    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Check</strong> eight link depth on enemies. Hostile creatures that enter the aura cannot leave its area. This lasts for one minute, or until your link breaks.</p><p><strong>Sustain:</strong> two link depth.</p><p><strong>Energize:</strong> Expend two link depth. Until Trouble ends, hostile creatures also cannot enter your aura.</p><p><a href=\"https://dnd-wiki.org/wiki/Empath_(5e_Class)\">Source: Empath by Axis, co-authored by Ghostwheel</a> (CC BY-SA 3.0). See the module's AUTOMATION.md for what is automated and how rules are interpreted.</p>",
